# Nested ignore for the LegionPhysics addon. Scoped to THIS tree only — it does not
# change csproj policy for any other project in the repo.
#
# The repo-root .gitignore blanket-ignores *.csproj (root .gitignore line 4) because most
# OpenSim projects are GENERATED by prebuild.xml and their csprojs are reproducible from a
# clean checkout + prebuild. LegionPhysics is the opposite case: it is hand-maintained
# (runprebuild is forbidden against this tree) and BRAND NEW, so its csprojs carry the ONLY
# copy of the project definition — the explicit <Compile> lists AND the JoltPhysicsSharp
# 2.18.6 PackageReference. Under the root rule a clean checkout of jolt-physics-m1 cannot
# build this addon at all. Re-include both csprojs so the build is reproducible.
# (Mirrors the root's Phlox exceptions; see the legion-csproj-gitignored memory.)
!*.csproj

# The repo root also ignores .gitignore itself (root .gitignore line 3). Re-include THIS
# nested file so the exception above travels with a clean clone instead of living in a
# single working tree. bin/ and obj/ remain ignored via the root patterns — not negated here.
!.gitignore
